- !<Text/d3e0e040-ae2d-46d8-9d06-08b4d0ff9b9a>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    BezierLine draws curved ribbons between objects and keeps them attached while things move.
    
    Pinch a card to move it and its ribbons follow. Drag from a dot to a dot on another card to connect them; tap a dot to clear its lines.
    
    The panel under the board changes the ribbon width, curve, segments and flow markers.
